# P103 on GtkBackend on macOS (TEST_BACKEND=gtk4), part 2: choose in the long-press picker, Add, delete, the 📍 pin,
# the inline picker and a typed value.
# Positions from the GTK window on 2026-10-17 (480x985 pt; origin=frame, 28 pt title bar): 便利商店's emoji 43,277;
# in its sheet (drawn inside the window) the ⛽ cell 165,382; field 100,363, Add 233,363; 加油站's ✕ 255,321; pin 266,158;
# inline picker's ⛽ cell 191,527 and its filter field 195,822.
# Pass (p103-emoji.log): ROW 便利商店 picker; ROW 便利商店 emoji ⛽; ROW added bank #8e24aa; ROW removed 加油站;
# PIN closed; PIN open; PICKER chose ⛽; PICKER chose bank (typed, no name matches).
# Keys are 150 ms apart: sent back to back, GTK typed "bann" for b,a,n,k (2026-10-17). The window is 960 pt tall so a fourth
# row does not resize it: GTK grows the window from its bottom-left corner on macOS, moving everything under the pinned origin.
